        "created_at": "2015-12-28T19:57:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just played a five-way game of DB:The DB game and it ended in a five-way tie at zero points. Someone who felt they were behind intentionally ended the game when no one could score.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this legal? Have I missed a rule somewhere in which the game only ends if the player who has no cards also has a valid deck?</p>",
