        "created_at": "2015-12-29T00:19:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So whenever the other player runs out of cards to play the rest of the round would still be played out (if this person was first everyone else at the tbsle still gets one turn). &nbsp;So if you've still got a turn in that round I'd hope you have enough to finish a scoring deck since I imagine you might keep a closer check on what remains in his deck. &nbsp;</p>",
